--- !u!114 &765293066
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 765293064}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'TOTALLY RIDICULOUS RUNWAY

    Drive a deliberately cute, controlled walking
    truck through the indoor fashion hub. Movement steers, sways and bounces the
    original complete tractor assembly; this choreography is local to Fashion. Visit
    the marked hat, face, wheel or mirror/accessory shop, or the dressing room, and
    press your assigned ACTION. The existing FREE customizer provides real asset
    previews, camera rotation, equip, SAVE and CANCEL over YOUR stable named profile.
    No currency, purchases or unlocks. Unsaved previews never replace another participant''s
    outfit. Press ACTION near the runway entrance or your READY button when prepared.
    After sixty live seconds the show begins with the actual saved outfits.

    Four
    contestants include one to four assigned humans and AI. Each walks on individually
    while others watch. Steer to the entrance, then LEFT / DOWN / UP / RIGHT prompts
    use the existing Dance-Off lane controls: assigned movement keys, whole-pad D-pad/face
    buttons, or the assigned shared stick. Inputs are judged once, with forgiving
    Great120ms / Good280ms windows; wrong presses reduce timing score. Successful
    prompts cause real strut/pose/spin/showcase choreography. Keep walking toward
    the final mark; the controlled performance pace advances only during your runway
    turn. There are twelve prompts and an actual final-mark completion award.

    Judges
    score actual composed-item theme tags, coordinated gold/chrome/cherry finishes,
    accessory variety, actual QTE accuracy, successful poses and real runway completion.
    Scores show each component; no random judging. The four available themes match
    real current catalog content. AI shops/equips real assets and uses difficulty-timed
    input through the same Dance rules. Pause/reconnect gate held inputs without
    granting notes; rematch starts a fresh show while saved outfits persist. The
    later cross-sport economy is deliberately deferred.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
